:''Not to be confused with [[Catseye Nebula (Cats of the Cosmos)|Catseye Nebula]].''

'''Catseyes''' are obtainable items unlocked when reaching 1,600 [[User Rank]] and were added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]]. Catseyes allow units to be upgraded past Lv.30. Each Catseye allows the player to increase the maximum normal level cap of a unit by 1, but the player still needs to use XP to upgrade the Cat to that level. The maximum cap level increase allowed by using Catseye is level limit of +10, which is increased to +20 if [[An Ancient Curse]] is beaten. [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] may not be upgraded above Lv.30 until An Ancient Curse is beaten, after which they can be upgraded to Lv.40. They can be upgraded to Lv.50 after clearing [[Revival of Origin]].

Example: a unit can reach Lv.30 normally with XP upgrades. Using one Catseye will increase that unit's level cap to Lv.31+, with maximum up to Lv.40, or Lv.50 if the player has beaten An Ancient Curse. From Lv.46 to Lv.50 and Lv.56 to Lv.60, <u>two Catseyes are needed per upgrade</u>.

*Therefore, the total Catseyes use to increase the level cap of a unit from Lv.30 to Lv.50 = '''25 Catseyes.''' For Uber Rares from Lv.50 to Lv.60, it'll charge you '''15 Dark Catseyes'''.
*The Cat Unit also has to reach level 30 from XP upgrades first, therefore making it impossible for a player to use Catseyes on certain units before reaching specific [[User Rank]] levels, even if a player gained Catseyes beforehand.

Currently, there exists 6 types of Catseyes: Special, Rare, Super Rare, Uber Rare, Legend and Dark. The first four can only be used on Cats of their specific rarity, Legend Catseyes can be used on any rarity, including Legend Rares, and Dark Catseyes are the same, but can also be used to upgrade Uber Rares beyond Lv.50 and up to Lv.60.

