==Obtaining Catseyes==
Catseyes can be obtained from certain [[Gamatoto Expedition]] areas, the [[Cat Shrine]], [[Catseye Capsule]], through in-app purchases or Event Stages like [[The Proving Grounds]]. You can find the number of Catseyes you currently have in the [[Upgrade Menu]].

