==Notes==
*Legend Catseyes and Dark Catseyes may be used as a substitute for other Catseyes if the player doesn't have enough, though it's generally ill-advised to do so.

==Existence Elsewhere==
===[[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event|Princess Punt Sweets]]===
Special Catseyes appear in the form of 4★ upgrade materials, obtainable from achievements tied to the collab stages. Rare Catseyes also appear as 4★ upgrade materials that can be obtained as special drops from sending a GAMATOTO helper out to explore. Legend Catseyes drop from every main collab stage, once again in the form of an upgrade material.
